{
  "doc_id": "scene.chapter_38_jungle_fever",
  "chapter": 38,
  "title": null,
  "when": "Unknown.scene_chapter_38_jungle_fever",
  "where": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
  "scope": "narrative",
  "entities": [
    "geralt",
    "senareth",
    "unknown"
  ],
  "scene_id": "scene.chapter_38_jungle_fever",
  "segment_index": 0,
  "segment_count": 687,
  "segment_hash": "5d6e85922409",
  "block_title": "scene.chapter_38_jungle_fever",
  "beats": [
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chapter 39."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---  at"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt didn’t shout."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pointed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrows flew—green chroniton trails cutting precise arcs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They struck three Needles simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Crystal shrieked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet light stuttered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar charged—a silent avalanche of muscle and fury."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His blade sliced through Reptilian spines before they turned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shieldbearers surged forward, locking overlapping barriers as Igigi scattered in confusion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s lance became a conductor’s baton, directing Legionnaires to isolate each spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s song surged through Geralt, pure and furious."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He plunged his gauntlet into the corrupted Nexus pool."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cold fire raced up his arm—Anunnaki rot fighting Earth’s heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Black tendrils lashed, tearing at his soul. *\"Pour it back!\"* Luminaire cried."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt roared, pouring five hundred Legion souls’ harmonic will through the gauntlet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gold light erupted, incinerating the darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Needles shattered like glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, the Garden breathed free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire sighed: *\"Anchor... held...\"* But reptilian horns blared in the distance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The hunt was on."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance decay in twelve seconds!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gate destabilizing!\" Geralt ripped his gauntlet from the cleansed Nexus."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silver light already engulfed the Legion—transit energy fraying at the edges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Rho formation!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Homeward sigil—now!\" Oreck’s arrows traced the dragonway glyph in emerald flame."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires locked shields, vrill-chant rising to a crescendo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s light pulsed weakly. *\"Mars... calling...\"* Earth’s gravity tugged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mist thickened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Distant reptilian screams choked into silence as silver consumed sight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s last glimpse: Igigi survivors vanishing into ferns, their eyes wide with dawning hope."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then—cold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Void."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Weightlessness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s presence flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A final whisper: *\"Remember... the Garden...\"*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence slammed down—deep, sterile, red."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s boots crunched Martian sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dragon Nebula light bathed the Legion in sapphire gloom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s spire stood whole again—obsidian gleaming under alien stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire sighed within Geralt’s palm: *\"Duty... fulfilled.\"* Relief warred with exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar spat crimson dust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika scanned dead skies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No dragons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No wyrms."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only desolation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck lowered his bow, fingers trembling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner blinked: \"Transit integrity confirmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth resonance stable.\" But Geralt felt it—the Nebula’s watchful gaze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Judgment deferred."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not ended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He tightened his grip on Luminara’s fading warmth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The war waited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth bled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And four storm-lit figures lingered in memory—lightning fists, star-woven robes, shadows that killed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Questions coiled like vipers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But for now... breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Home for the weary."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Victory tasted like ashes and ozone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion lived."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Garden endured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Next?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle breathed wrong."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where Geralt remembered mist-laced calm, now humid air vibrated with predatory awareness—a sentient pressure against his eardrums."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Canopy gaps revealed pyramids swallowed by writhing vines that pulsed faint crimson beneath moss, like infected arteries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian shrieks echoed not from distance, but from camouflaged emitters woven into strangler figs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anunnaki tech wasn’t just reactivated; it had metastasized into the ecosystem itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vrill-energy, once Earth’s song, now thrummed as a weaponized drone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara shuddered in Geralt’s palm, her light guttering. *\"Roots... digging deep...\"*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck vanished into a curtain of phosphorescent creepers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His salvaged armor—scavenged from Heavens wreck—hummed in perfect resonance with the pyramid’s defensive lattice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To thermal scanners, he was background radiation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To Geralt’s enhanced senses, he moved like a ghost tracing fault lines: here, a buried power conduit; there, a sonic tripwire disguised as orchid pollen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His bowstring glowed emerald, charged by stolen energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He knew where the nexus hid—not in the central chamber, but beneath the sacrificial altar, where agony amplified the signal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion saw ruins."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck saw circuitry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the Anunnaki weren’t building fortresses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were grafting themselves onto Earth’s bones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar crouched beside a petrified log, nostrils flaring."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Igigi sweat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fear-scent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fresh.\" Mika’s lance tip trembled—not from exhaustion, but rage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, through cracked basalt, faint crimson light illuminated cages stacked like cordwood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Igigi prisoners huddled inside, their vrill-dampening collars flickering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian guards patrolled above, claws clicking on stone fused with crystalline cabling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Nexus resonance spike imminent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reinforcements inbound.\" Geralt’s command was a blade-honed whisper: \"Oreck."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Disrupt it.\" The air thickened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines tensed like coiled serpents."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sentinel trees shifted, bark splitting to reveal gunmetal apertures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle watched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Cut the root,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "he thought, nocking an arrow tipped with stolen chroniton energy. The air screamed. Violet light erupted from the sphere—too late. Oreck released. Emerald met entropy. The world tore open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Aboveground, Geralt felt the shockwave through his boots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle convulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines retracted like whipped tentacles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner shrieked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Nexus destabilization!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cascade effect—all local nodes failing!\" Halvar grinned, teeth bloody in twilight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika slammed her lance down, shield-wall flaring silver."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian guards stumbled, their control collars sparking."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Igigi prisoners surged against cages."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Freedom’s first breath tasted electric."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her light spluttered, then flared—gold bleeding through jungle gloom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Push!\" he roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires charged, blades singing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yet Geralt knew: Oreck’s strike was a scalpel, not a cure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Roots ran deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beneath the altar, the nexus sphere shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck rolled aside as violet backlash scorched stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Green light bled from his armor—camouflage failing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Footsteps pounded down hidden corridors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Heavy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Many."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He scrambled up rubble, bow humming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A shadow filled the doorway—taller than memory, armored in obsidian scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its eyes glowed crimson."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Recognition flickered. *Serpentor-Prime.* Oreck froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His finger slipped on the bowstring."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fatigue betrayed him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The arrow clattered uselessly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Serpentor hissed, low and triumphant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Deserter.\" Claws gleamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s armor sparked, resonance severed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle’s heartbeat paused."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, Lyra’s scanner flashed crimson."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Anomaly detected!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sub-Level Bio-Signature—Oreck’s vitals spiking!\" Geralt spun."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara pulsed frantic warnings. *Trapped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Betrayed.* Halvar snarled, already moving toward the pyramid’s hidden entrance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika locked shields, buying seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires formed a retreating wedge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s command sliced through chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Halvar—extract him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now!\" But vines snapped shut, sealing the entrance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stone groaned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The pyramid *moved*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Roots anchoring."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Serpentor’s laughter echoed through tremoring earth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s bow lay broken."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His armor dimmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Crimson eyes closed in."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, Oreck’s breath burned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Serpentor’s claws hovered—obsidian death."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Recognition flashed: *Prime Enforcer*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The armor’s stolen resonance flickered, then died."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Betrayed by fatigue."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yet Oreck’s gaze dropped to the altar rubble."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shattered nexus fragments glowed gold-black."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth’s pain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His fingers brushed cold stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A memory surfaced—training drills on Martian dunes. *When resonance fails, fracture the harmonics.* He slammed his palm into a fragment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gold light flared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Serpentor hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields faltered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck rolled—snatched the fallen arrow—impaled the fragment into the altar’s central vein."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald chroniton met corrupted gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The explosion wasn’t fire—it was silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pure, deafening."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Serpentor staggered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Roots screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above ground, the jungle convulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pyramids shuddered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines recoiled as if scalded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s shield-wall buckled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra screamed: \"Nexus Node Gamma—critical failure!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "All local systems destabilizing!\" Geralt felt it—a tremor through Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth’s sigh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar tore at sealed vines."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stone cracked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires cheered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Geralt watched the sky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Distant thunder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wings."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian reinforcements—darker, faster."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara dimmed. *Roots... deeper...* Victory tasted bitter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck crawled free—bleeding, silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar hauled him up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika met Geralt’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hope flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Too small."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Too late."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle waited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Breathing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck leaned against cracked stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His armor flickered—camouflage failing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar scanned the treeline."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her light traced crimson emitters in writhing vines."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below their boots, stone hummed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vrill-lines pulsed, bleeding violet energy toward distant peaks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika whispered: \"They're feeding the network.\" Lyra’s scanner hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance rebuilding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma... regenerating.\" Oreck choked out words: \"Weakening roots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Parasite logic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cut one... others compensate.\" He touched a vine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stolen armor synced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald light bled through corrupted veins."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet tightened. *Roots.* Always roots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anunnaki weren’t invading."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were grafting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Feeding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Becoming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara wept: *The Garden remembers pain...*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, Serpentor’s corpse twitched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Obsidian armor melted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gold-black nexus fragments seeped into stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck staggered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Primary node... underground... beneath the altar.\" Halvar grinned—blood on teeth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires formed ranks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shields locked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika raised her lance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt nodded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fight deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cut deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Roots waited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence gathered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Thunder roared closer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mist thickened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Rain began—acid-slick."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle watched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legion marched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Into darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Toward the heart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s bow hummed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald light bled through cracks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth trembled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not in fear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In fury."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Garden awakened—and it remembered vengeance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle breathed lies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s first warning wasn’t the crimson pulse beneath the vines but the alien disgust coiling through his neural link."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Applicator—usually humming with detached analysis—spat diagnostics like poison: *“Vrill resonance inverted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not amplification."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cognitive corruption: Truth reframed as suggestion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Memory malleation event likely.”* This wasn’t integration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was perversion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, the Legion advanced through suffocating green twilight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Private Ren froze beside a dripping fern."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His hand trembled near his blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re slowing down for *me*,\" he muttered, eyes darting at Halvar’s broad back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A nearby vine throbbed softly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren’s whisper echoed back, colder: \"They’ll leave you behind... just like on Mars.\" His knuckles whitened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He knew the source—the grafted vrill whispering through root-filaments—yet the dread felt *his*, marrow-deep and shameful."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s Applicator flared hot behind his temple."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Diagnostics blazed crimson:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> VRILL RESONANCE INVERSION DETECTED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> COGNITIVE CORRUPTION PROTOCOL ENGAGED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> TRUTH FRAME SHIFT: SUGGESTION → MEMORY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> MALLEATION EVENT IMMINENT"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle exhaled decay-sweet breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s shoulders tensed beside him—not at Reptilian claws scraping stone, but at the whispers threading through dripping fronds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Private Ren’s blade trembled near a pulsing vine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re slowing down for *me*,\" the Legionnaire choked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vine answered in Ren’s own voice, colder: \"Just like Mars.\" Ren’s knuckles whitened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He knew the source—the grafted vrill was a parasite in the air—yet the shame felt bone-deep. *His* failing. *His* abandonment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, Mika’s lance wavered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shieldbearers formed overlapping barriers, but the corruption slithered beneath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An Igigi prisoner pressed against crystalline bars—his eyes vacant, lips moving: \"The chains fit better now...\" The vine above him crooned back: \"Quiet is safety.\" Geralt felt Luminara shudder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her golden light trembled against encroaching violet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This wasn’t attack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was seduction."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Truth reborn as doubt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion marched deeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Roots snaked across their path, throbbing like infected arteries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s salvaged armor sparked—emerald light flickering where it touched stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His fingers brushed a moss-slick obelisk."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instantly, Senareth’s voice echoed: *\"Endurance is surrender.\"* It wasn’t Senareth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was Oreck’s deepest fear—wrapped in his mentor’s timbre."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He recoiled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His bow clattered against rock."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sound amplified tenfold, swallowed by jungle laughter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His ax hovered mid-swing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the neural link, Geralt tasted copper and salt—the sergeant’s memory-flash: Mars, sand choking his brother’s lungs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vines hissed: \"Too slow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Always too slow.\" Halvar roared—not in battle-fury, but anguish."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shadows deepened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vril-light bent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Garden remembered pain, and now it weaponized regret."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Victory required more than blades."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It demanded belief in unraveling minds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle’s whispers thickened as twilight bled into deep violet gloom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s knuckles whitened around his axe handle; every rustling leaf echoed with his brother’s dying gasps from Mars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We stop *here*,\" Geralt commanded, slicing through the mental fog with Luminara’s flickering gold light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The clearing was a trap—vines coiled like sleeping serpents, obelisks humming with inverted resonance—but exhaustion outweighed caution."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires collapsed against petrified logs, eyes darting at shifting shadows."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren’s hand trembled near his blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’ll slit our throats while we sleep,\" he muttered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vine above him sighed back: \"*Sleep is surrender.*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck traced glyphs in the damp soil—ancient Martian warding sigils."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His salvaged armor sputtered emerald light where it touched the symbols, pushing back the cognitive poison."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The corruption targets doubt,\" he rasped, sweat stinging his eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Fix your thoughts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Anchor them.\" Mika knelt beside him, her lance plunged into soft earth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shield energy flared silver, carving a fragile dome of clarity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Within it, the air tasted cleaner—pine and ozone instead of decay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yet outside, the jungle pulsed, alive with malice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Distant Igigi whimpers twisted into accusations: \"*You abandoned us.*\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar paced the perimeter, axe gleaming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Focus on the weight,\" Geralt ordered, his Applicator scorching against his skull."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"*Feel* your boots crushing stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hear my voice.\" Ren flinched as vines whispered his darkest shame—the Martian outpost he’d fled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Ignore echoes,\" Geralt growled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re thorns, not truths.\" Luminara’s glow brightened, casting long, defiant shadows."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Around them, the Legionnaires clutched weapons, lips moving in silent mantras: names of home, rhythms of drills, equations of vrill-flow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Resistance was a raw, scraping thing—a refusal to let their minds be unmade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Deep in the undergrowth, obsidian eyes watched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three reptilian scouts, scales tuned to the corrupted harmonics, tasted the shield’s disruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their claws flexed, ready to rend flesh *or* sanity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet tightened on Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tonight, they’d hold this line."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tomorrow, they’d cut deeper toward the heart—and rip the poison from its roots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle pressed closer, its whispers threading through the shield-dome like poisoned needles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s axe trembled—not from fatigue, but from the vine-murmur replaying his brother’s last rattling breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He slammed the blade into the soil, anchoring himself in the vibration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Weight,\" Geralt commanded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Focus on gravity.\" Legionnaires echoed the mantra, gripping weapons until knuckles bled white."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren’s eyelids fluttered as the corruption hissed: *Coward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Weak.* He bit his tongue, tasting copper, and whispered his daughter’s name instead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A small defiance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, the canopy writhed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet light pulsed through veins in the leaves—Anunnaki tech feeding on doubt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner flared crimson."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Cognitive resonance intensifying!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shield integrity at 65%.\" Mika’s lance dug deeper into the earth, silver light fraying at the edges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck pressed his palm against a glyph-carved obelisk."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald energy flared, pushing back the gloom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re amplifying our fears,\" he rasped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Twisting memory into traps.\" Senareth’s voice slithered from a nearby vine: *\"You failed me.\"* Oreck snarled, shattering the stone with a chroniton-charged arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The lie crumbled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence followed—brief, electric."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the jungle screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines lashed like whips, thorns gleaming with venom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian shadows detached from the trees, claws scraping stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar roared, axe cleaving through scaled flesh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s shield-wall flared, deflecting psychic shrieks that tasted of burnt ozone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her golden light seared through the violet haze, revealing three scouts—obsidian-scaled, eyes vacant—advancing with mechanical precision."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Legionnaires met them blade-to-claw, screams swallowed by the storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One scout lunged at Ren."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Time slowed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legionnaire saw Martian sand, his own retreating footsteps."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then Geralt’s voice cut through: \"Nowhere to run here.\" Ren’s blade found the creature’s throat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Black blood sprayed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle recoiled, hissing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the lull, Oreck touched a dying scout’s armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Resonance flickered—a map of pain etched in vrill."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They’re conduits,\" he breathed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The corruption flows *through* them.\" Geralt’s Applicator burned: *Parasitic symbiosis confirmed*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cut the scouts, and the roots would bleed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, thunder gathered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not rain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wings."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Darker."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Closer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shield-dome flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Victory was a shallow breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dawn felt lifetimes away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck crouched beside the scout's corpse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His fingers brushed cold scales, syncing his salvaged armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald light pulsed through the reptile's neural lattice—a fractal map of agony etched in vrill."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Parasite lines fed into distant nodes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They're not soldiers,\" he hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They're nerve endings."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pain amplifiers.\" Geralt's Applicator scalded his temple: VERIFIED."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "COGNITIVE CORRUPTION VECTORS: NEURAL-SYNTHETIC SYMBIOSIS."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "TERMINATE HOSTS TO SEVER FEEDBACK LOOPS."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar wiped black blood from his axe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"So we kill the messengers?\" His voice was gravel scraped raw."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"Worse,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Private Ren stared at his bloodied blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then—we're helping them?\" The vine above him sighed: *Always helping.*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika's shield flared silver as another psychic shriek hit—burnt ozone and despair."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"How do we fight a forest that eats doubt?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck's arrow hummed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton-tipped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We don't fight.\" He nocked it, aiming at the scout's twitching spine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We cauterize.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shot was a whisper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald light pierced scaled flesh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instantly, the corpse *screamed*—not sound, but silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A vacuum that sucked the air from lungs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines recoiled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet pulses stuttered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, the winged thunder faltered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra's scanner chirruped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Local corruption resonance... dropping?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt it—a tremor through Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Earth's sigh of relief."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But his Applicator blazed crimson: WARNING: NODE GAMMA REACTIVATING."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "PARASITE LOGIC ADAPTING."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck's armor flickered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Senareth's voice slithered from the ground: *You only delayed the harvest.*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar growled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They rebuilt faster.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"No.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stared at the scout's ashen scales. Black veins now glowed gold-*green*. The very hue of Oreck's arrow. \"They *learned*.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle held its breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the roots began to sing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It started where Oreck’s chroniton arrow had struck—a low, dissonant hum vibrating through the scout’s corpse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The gold-green veins pulsed like infected lightning, spreading through petrified wood and moss-slick stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where the Legion stood, the ground trembled—not in threat, but in terrible imitation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines uncoiled, lifting toward the canopy as if conducting an unseen orchestra."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The notes tasted of copper and spoiled honey on Geralt’s tongue."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Private Ren clapped hands over his ears."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Make it stop—\" His plea fractured into the jungle’s stolen timbre."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"—stop pretending you can save us!\" The vines echoed, weaving his despair into harmony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shieldbearers stumbled back as Mika’s lance dimmed; the silver dome flickered, its light thinning against the rising chorus."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar gripped his axe, knuckles pale."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It’s mirroring us,\" he growled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Feeding on our silence.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner shrieked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Resonance replication detected!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corruption adapting to chroniton frequency—\" Her voice broke as the jungle whispered her own diagnosis back: *Adaptation equals extinction.* Geralt slammed Luminara’s base into the soil."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Golden light flared, searing vines that crept too close."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The applicator burned against his skull: PARASITE ISOLATING HOST NEURAL SIGNATURES."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ESTABLISHING RESONANT FEEDBACK LOOP."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But beneath the warning, a deeper truth shimmered: The green-gold veins weren’t just copying Oreck’s attack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were *learning* it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Perfecting it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck crouched beside the scout, fingers pressed to corrupted scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His armor synced—emerald light writhing against gold-green intrusion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the neural link, Geralt felt it: fractal patterns unfolding like poisoned flowers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It’s not defense,\" Oreck breathed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It’s rehearsal.\" Senareth’s voice coiled through the roots— *For the Garden’s requiem*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above them, winged shadows banked lower, their flight paths syncing to the dissonant hymn."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air thickened with anticipation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika raised her lance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Do we retreat?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt watched a vine stroke Ren’s trembling shoulder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Comfort now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tender as a grave."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Stand fast,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "he ordered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Let it listen closer.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara pulsed—not attack, but invitation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her light carved a single, pure note into the cacophony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A question only sorrow could answer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle hesitated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines froze mid-reach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, the singing stuttered,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "as if remembering it had no throat of its own."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the ground heaved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stone split like rotten fruit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From the fissure rose a serpentine root,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "thicker than a warship’s hull,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "studded with glittering Anunnaki emitters—"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "and humming with Ren’s stolen terror,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s guilt,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s faith."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Awake."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Alive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No one breathed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion’s defiance echoed in the silence—"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "not as weapon,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "but as bait."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vine-monster swayed,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "drunk on their pain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s fingers tightened on Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Now.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The root-monster swayed—a grotesque parody of breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren’s terror thrummed through its bark-carved emitters; Halvar’s guilt pulsed in the veins of its thorns."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It didn’t attack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It *listened*, drinking the Legion’s silence like poison wine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s Applicator screamed:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> RESONANCE FEEDBACK LOOP STABILIZED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> NODE GAMMA ASSIMILATING HOST SIGNATURES"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> COUNTERMEASURES: NEGATIVE PROBABILITY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s gold light sputtered as the root hummed louder—not a battle cry, but a twisted chorus of their own voices."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren whimpered as it sang *\"Coward\"* in his daughter’s stolen lilt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s axe trembled; the vine mirrored his shaking grip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck nocked another chroniton arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It’s reflecting us!\" His armor flared emerald, but Node Gamma instantly bled gold-green—copying the frequency."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dissonance scraped teeth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Cease fire!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt barked. Every counterattack became data for the parasite. He forced stillness. Luminara dimmed to a dying ember."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The jungle held its breath."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines coiled tighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dirt crumbled into the fissure as Node Gamma heaved upward, dripping acidic sap that hissed against Mika’s flickering shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air reeked of ozone and rotting orchids."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s knuckles cracked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Do we die waiting?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"Wait longer,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A vine lashed toward Ren—slow, inquisitive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It brushed his cheek, cold as reptilian scales."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He froze, tears carving paths through grime."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The root crooned: *\"Safe now.\"*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s lance flared silver."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Now, commander—\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Hold!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s voice cut steel."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vine tightened around Ren’s throat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emerald veins pulsed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma leaned in—a hunter savoring surrender."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrow trembled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s breath roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the suffocating quiet, Geralt’s Applicator flickered once:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> PARASITE ATTENTION THRESHOLD: 98%"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> READY—"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The root lunged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren’s choked gasp echoed through the emitters—amplified into a shriek that shattered Mika’s shield-wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Acidic sap rained down as vines erupted from the fissure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt drove Luminara into the soil."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her golden light flared—not against the root, but *through* it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma’s core pulsed crimson where Ren’s stolen memories bled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The parasite had consumed suffering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now it choked on hope."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar moved first."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not toward the monster, but sideways—his axe carving sigils into stone Oreck had marked hours earlier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Martian ward-runes flared emerald."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vines recoiled as ancestral geometry scorched their false flesh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The distraction lasted seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Long enough."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck loosed his arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not at the core, but into the soil where Node Gamma’s roots drank deep."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chroniton energy bloomed downward—a temporal anchor dragging the parasite toward its own creation moment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The monster shuddered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emitters spat static."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, Geralt saw it: the Anunnaki drill biting into virgin earth fifteen years past."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The root *remembered* being a weapon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the memory curdled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gold-green veins thickened, swallowing the chroniton pulse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma learned—adapting its resonance to mimic Oreck’s armor frequency."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dissonance slammed Geralt to his knees."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara’s light fractured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shadows deepened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A vine wrapped Mika’s throat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Another pinned Halvar’s axe-arm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren sobbed as roots pried open his mind, mining fresh despair."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s Applicator burned:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> PARASITE ADAPTATION RATE EXCEEDING TOLERANCES"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "> COUNTERMEASURE: RESONANT SACRIFICE?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Y/"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn’t hesitate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Standing, he ripped the Applicator from his temple."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Blood streamed down his cheek as he pressed the scorching metal to Luminara’s haft."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Take it all,\" he whispered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not command."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Invitation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The relic blazed—feeding on his pain, his doubt, the weight of every Legionnaire’s scream."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her light shifted from gold to blinding white."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma recoiled, emitters overloading as pure, unfiltered humanity flooded its circuits."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For the first time, the jungle screamed—not imitation, but agony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika gasped free."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above them, wings dove through the canopy—too fast, too late."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck nocked his last arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The root twitched—not in retreat, but anticipation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Learning again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Always learning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Here is the revised ending with the new twist about the Applicator — a rogue duplicate communicating with the hive, while the real one remains hidden and intact."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The blinding white light seared Geralt’s vision, throbbing against Node Gamma’s corrupted heart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Acidic sap hissed where it struck vines, vaporizing into acrid clouds that stung the Legionnaires’ throats."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the glare, Geralt glimpsed the parasite’s core pulsing faster—not overwhelmed, but analyzing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Absorbing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its gold-green veins flared brighter, synchronizing with Luminara’s desperate resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren crumpled to his knees, clutching his temples."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It’s inside my skull,\" he choked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Counting my breaths.\" The root echoed him perfectly: a thousand whispering vines replicating each ragged gasp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s shield flickered back to life, silver light straining against the cognitive tide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar swung his axe—not at the root, but at the rune-carved earth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Martian glyphs flared emerald beneath its twisting tendrils."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stone groaned instead of screaming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A distraction."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck didn’t flinch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His arrow’s chroniton tip hummed with stolen time—the spark before impact."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He aimed low, beneath the root’s armored segments, toward threads binding it to the deeper network."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Feeding tube,\" he hissed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt nodded, blood dripping from his temple onto Luminara’s haft."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The relic drank it greedily, light wavering between white and sickly gold-green imitation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Parasite logic adapted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Patience wore thin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, wings shredded the canopy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reptilian scouts descended in silence, claws extended not for flesh, but for the fractured shield-dome."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their scales vibrated with the jungle’s stolen chorus—Halvar’s guilt, Ren’s terror, Oreck’s faith—amplified into weapons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika met them with lance raised, her defiance a raw scream swallowed by dissonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Senareth’s voice slithered through the roots once more: All gardens end."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt tightened his grip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Not yet.\" Luminara pulsed—a final, searing note of pure defiance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma shuddered, emitters flaring crimson."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, its song fractured into static."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the serpentine root lunged—not at Geralt, but at Oreck’s drawn bow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Learning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Always learning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Geralt’s Applicator—the one fused to his temple—didn’t just analyze the attack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It approved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A faint, encrypted pulse bled from his skull into the root’s core."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A data packet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma absorbed it instantly, its next movement preempting Oreck’s shot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The arrow shattered mid-air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not from pain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From realization."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Emergency preservation tactics it began duplicity…"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Applicator had been compromised."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not corrupted—replaced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A duplicate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And it wasn’t just adapting to the hive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was communicating with it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every tactical readout, every resonance scan, every flicker of Legionnaire fear—it had been streaming to Node Gamma."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The parasite wasn’t learning on its own."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was being taught."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar roared, axe biting deep into a vine—but the vine had already hardened at the point of impact."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pre-adapted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Betrayed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s hand shot to his temple."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not to deactivate it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To rip it out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The duplicate Applicator resisted, bio-filaments tearing from his neural ports."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It shrieked in his mind—not a machine error, but a hive-alert."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gold-green light bled from its casing as it came free, writhing in his grip like a caught insect."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For a second, he saw it clearly: a perfect replica, down to the wear on its edges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But inside, its core glowed with the same venomous violet as the jungle’s emitters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He crushed it against Luminara’s haft."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The duplicate sparked, died, and went dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma hesitated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its song stuttered, emitters cycling through frequencies—searching for the feed that had just gone dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was blind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For the first time, it was truly alone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And in that silence, Geralt’s real Applicator—the one buried in his occipital nerve cluster, dormant since Mars—booted up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No fanfare."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No diagnostic chime."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Just a clean, cold stream of data across his vision:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "PRIMARY APPLICATOR ONLINE."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "DUPLICATE LOG TERMINATED."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "HIVE FEEDBACK LOOP SEVERED."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ANALYSIS: NODE GAMMA RESONANCE PATTERN LOCKED TO DUPLICATE PROTOCOLS."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "PROTOCOL DELTA ENGAGED: COUNTER-RESONANCE MIRRORING READY."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s lips curled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a smile."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A baring of teeth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The duplicate had been feeding the hive their strategies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now, the real Applicator would feed the hive its own."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not in defiance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In invitation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“You wanted our resonance?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s voice cut through the stillness. “Here it is. Filtered. Weaponized.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He let the real Applicator flood Node Gamma with a perfected, mirrored echo of everything the duplicate had sent—but inverted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s guilt became resolve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ren’s terror became clarity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s faith became certainty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The parasite, trained on the duplicate’s data, couldn’t adapt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It choked on the contradiction."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma screamed—a raw, mechanical shriek untouched by stolen souls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its gold-green veins blackened, seared by the truth of its own stolen logic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Above, wings faltered, scouts tumbling from the sky as their harmonic link shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shield-dome flared pure silver, Mika’s lance blazing with renewed light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar didn’t need an order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His axe found the root’s core."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This time, it bit deep."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This time, it bled black."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dawn’s first light pierced the canopy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It found them broken."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Bleeding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But united."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And aware."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The real war wasn’t just against the jungle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was against the lies they carried with them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And Geralt’s real Applicator was now wide awake, listening not to the hive—"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But for the next traitor in their midst."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "End chapter 39"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chapter 39."
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---  at"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt didn’t shout."
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pointed."
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrows flew—green chroniton trails cutting precise arcs."
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They struck three Needles simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Crystal shrieked."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet light stuttered."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar charged—a silent avalanche of muscle and fury."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His blade sliced through Reptilian spines before they turned."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shieldbearers surged forward, locking overlapping barriers as Igigi scattered in confusion."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s lance became a conductor’s baton, directing Legionnaires to isolate each spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s song surged through Geralt, pure and furious."
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He plunged his gauntlet into the corrupted Nexus pool."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cold fire raced up his arm—Anunnaki rot fighting Earth’s heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Black tendrils lashed, tearing at his soul. *\"Pour it back!\"* Luminaire cried."
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt roared, pouring five hundred Legion souls’ harmonic will through the gauntlet."
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gold light erupted, incinerating the darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Needles shattered like glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, the Garden breathed free."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire sighed: *\"Anchor... held...\"* But reptilian horns blared in the distance."
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The hunt was on."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance decay in twelve seconds!"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gate destabilizing!\" Geralt ripped his gauntlet from the cleansed Nexus."
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silver light already engulfed the Legion—transit energy fraying at the edges."
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Rho formation!"
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Homeward sigil—now!\" Oreck’s arrows traced the dragonway glyph in emerald flame."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires locked shields, vrill-chant rising to a crescendo."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s light pulsed weakly. *\"Mars... calling...\"* Earth’s gravity tugged."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mist thickened."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Distant reptilian screams choked into silence as silver consumed sight."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s last glimpse: Igigi survivors vanishing into ferns, their eyes wide with dawning hope."
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then—cold."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Void."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weightlessness."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s presence flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A final whisper: *\"Remember... the Garden...\"*"
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence slammed down—deep, sterile, red."
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s boots crunched Martian sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dragon Nebula light bathed the Legion in sapphire gloom."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s spire stood whole again—obsidian gleaming under alien stars."
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire sighed within Geralt’s palm: *\"Duty... fulfilled.\"* Relief warred with exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar spat crimson dust."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika scanned dead skies."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No dragons."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No wyrms."
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only desolation."
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck lowered his bow, fingers trembling."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner blinked: \"Transit integrity confirmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earth resonance stable.\" But Geralt felt it—the Nebula’s watchful gaze."
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Judgment deferred."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not ended."
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He tightened his grip on Luminara’s fading warmth."
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The war waited."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earth bled."
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And four storm-lit figures lingered in memory—lightning fists, star-woven robes, shadows that killed."
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Questions coiled like vipers."
    },
    {
      "line": 62,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But for now... breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sand."
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Home for the weary."
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Victory tasted like ashes and ozone."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion lived."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Garden endured."
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Next?"
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle breathed wrong."
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where Geralt remembered mist-laced calm, now humid air vibrated with predatory awareness—a sentient pressure against his eardrums."
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Canopy gaps revealed pyramids swallowed by writhing vines that pulsed faint crimson beneath moss, like infected arteries."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian shrieks echoed not from distance, but from camouflaged emitters woven into strangler figs."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anunnaki tech wasn’t just reactivated; it had metastasized into the ecosystem itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vrill-energy, once Earth’s song, now thrummed as a weaponized drone."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara shuddered in Geralt’s palm, her light guttering. *\"Roots... digging deep...\"*"
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck vanished into a curtain of phosphorescent creepers."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His salvaged armor—scavenged from Heavens wreck—hummed in perfect resonance with the pyramid’s defensive lattice."
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To thermal scanners, he was background radiation."
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To Geralt’s enhanced senses, he moved like a ghost tracing fault lines: here, a buried power conduit; there, a sonic tripwire disguised as orchid pollen."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His bowstring glowed emerald, charged by stolen energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He knew where the nexus hid—not in the central chamber, but beneath the sacrificial altar, where agony amplified the signal."
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion saw ruins."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck saw circuitry."
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the Anunnaki weren’t building fortresses."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were grafting themselves onto Earth’s bones."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar crouched beside a petrified log, nostrils flaring."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Igigi sweat."
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fear-scent."
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fresh.\" Mika’s lance tip trembled—not from exhaustion, but rage."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, through cracked basalt, faint crimson light illuminated cages stacked like cordwood."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Igigi prisoners huddled inside, their vrill-dampening collars flickering."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian guards patrolled above, claws clicking on stone fused with crystalline cabling."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Nexus resonance spike imminent."
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reinforcements inbound.\" Geralt’s command was a blade-honed whisper: \"Oreck."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Disrupt it.\" The air thickened."
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines tensed like coiled serpents."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sentinel trees shifted, bark splitting to reveal gunmetal apertures."
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle watched."
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"Cut the root,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "he thought, nocking an arrow tipped with stolen chroniton energy. The air screamed. Violet light erupted from the sphere—too late. Oreck released. Emerald met entropy. The world tore open."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Aboveground, Geralt felt the shockwave through his boots."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle convulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines retracted like whipped tentacles."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner shrieked."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Nexus destabilization!"
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cascade effect—all local nodes failing!\" Halvar grinned, teeth bloody in twilight."
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika slammed her lance down, shield-wall flaring silver."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian guards stumbled, their control collars sparking."
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Igigi prisoners surged against cages."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Freedom’s first breath tasted electric."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her light spluttered, then flared—gold bleeding through jungle gloom."
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Push!\" he roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires charged, blades singing."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet Geralt knew: Oreck’s strike was a scalpel, not a cure."
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Roots ran deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beneath the altar, the nexus sphere shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck rolled aside as violet backlash scorched stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Green light bled from his armor—camouflage failing."
    },
    {
      "line": 129,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Footsteps pounded down hidden corridors."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian."
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Heavy."
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Many."
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He scrambled up rubble, bow humming."
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A shadow filled the doorway—taller than memory, armored in obsidian scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its eyes glowed crimson."
    },
    {
      "line": 136,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Recognition flickered. *Serpentor-Prime.* Oreck froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His finger slipped on the bowstring."
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fatigue betrayed him."
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The arrow clattered uselessly."
    },
    {
      "line": 140,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Serpentor hissed, low and triumphant."
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Deserter.\" Claws gleamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s armor sparked, resonance severed."
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle’s heartbeat paused."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, Lyra’s scanner flashed crimson."
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Anomaly detected!"
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sub-Level Bio-Signature—Oreck’s vitals spiking!\" Geralt spun."
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara pulsed frantic warnings. *Trapped."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Betrayed.* Halvar snarled, already moving toward the pyramid’s hidden entrance."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika locked shields, buying seconds."
    },
    {
      "line": 151,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires formed a retreating wedge."
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s command sliced through chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Halvar—extract him."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now!\" But vines snapped shut, sealing the entrance."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stone groaned."
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pyramid *moved*."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Roots anchoring."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Serpentor’s laughter echoed through tremoring earth."
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s bow lay broken."
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His armor dimmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Crimson eyes closed in."
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, Oreck’s breath burned."
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Serpentor’s claws hovered—obsidian death."
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Recognition flashed: *Prime Enforcer*."
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The armor’s stolen resonance flickered, then died."
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Betrayed by fatigue."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet Oreck’s gaze dropped to the altar rubble."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shattered nexus fragments glowed gold-black."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earth’s pain."
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His fingers brushed cold stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A memory surfaced—training drills on Martian dunes. *When resonance fails, fracture the harmonics.* He slammed his palm into a fragment."
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gold light flared."
    },
    {
      "line": 174,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Serpentor hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields faltered."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck rolled—snatched the fallen arrow—impaled the fragment into the altar’s central vein."
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald chroniton met corrupted gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The explosion wasn’t fire—it was silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pure, deafening."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Serpentor staggered."
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Roots screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above ground, the jungle convulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pyramids shuddered."
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines recoiled as if scalded."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s shield-wall buckled."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra screamed: \"Nexus Node Gamma—critical failure!"
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All local systems destabilizing!\" Geralt felt it—a tremor through Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earth’s sigh."
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar tore at sealed vines."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stone cracked."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires cheered."
    },
    {
      "line": 193,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Geralt watched the sky."
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Distant thunder."
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wings."
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian reinforcements—darker, faster."
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara dimmed. *Roots... deeper...* Victory tasted bitter."
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck crawled free—bleeding, silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar hauled him up."
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika met Geralt’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hope flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Too small."
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Too late."
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle waited."
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Breathing."
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck leaned against cracked stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 210,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His armor flickered—camouflage failing."
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar scanned the treeline."
    },
    {
      "line": 212,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her light traced crimson emitters in writhing vines."
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below their boots, stone hummed."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vrill-lines pulsed, bleeding violet energy toward distant peaks."
    },
    {
      "line": 217,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika whispered: \"They're feeding the network.\" Lyra’s scanner hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance rebuilding."
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma... regenerating.\" Oreck choked out words: \"Weakening roots."
    },
    {
      "line": 220,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Parasite logic."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cut one... others compensate.\" He touched a vine."
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stolen armor synced."
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald light bled through corrupted veins."
    },
    {
      "line": 224,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet tightened. *Roots.* Always roots."
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anunnaki weren’t invading."
    },
    {
      "line": 226,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were grafting."
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Feeding."
    },
    {
      "line": 228,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Becoming."
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara wept: *The Garden remembers pain...*"
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, Serpentor’s corpse twitched."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Obsidian armor melted."
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gold-black nexus fragments seeped into stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 234,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck staggered."
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Primary node... underground... beneath the altar.\" Halvar grinned—blood on teeth."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires formed ranks."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shields locked."
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika raised her lance."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt nodded."
    },
    {
      "line": 240,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fight deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cut deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 242,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Roots waited."
    },
    {
      "line": 243,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence gathered."
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thunder roared closer."
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mist thickened."
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rain began—acid-slick."
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle watched."
    },
    {
      "line": 248,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legion marched."
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Down."
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Into darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Toward the heart."
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s bow hummed."
    },
    {
      "line": 253,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald light bled through cracks."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earth trembled."
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not in fear."
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In fury."
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Garden awakened—and it remembered vengeance."
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 260,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle breathed lies."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s first warning wasn’t the crimson pulse beneath the vines but the alien disgust coiling through his neural link."
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Applicator—usually humming with detached analysis—spat diagnostics like poison: *“Vrill resonance inverted."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not amplification."
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cognitive corruption: Truth reframed as suggestion."
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Memory malleation event likely.”* This wasn’t integration."
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was perversion."
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, the Legion advanced through suffocating green twilight."
    },
    {
      "line": 269,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Private Ren froze beside a dripping fern."
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hand trembled near his blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 271,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re slowing down for *me*,\" he muttered, eyes darting at Halvar’s broad back."
    },
    {
      "line": 272,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A nearby vine throbbed softly."
    },
    {
      "line": 273,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren’s whisper echoed back, colder: \"They’ll leave you behind... just like on Mars.\" His knuckles whitened."
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He knew the source—the grafted vrill whispering through root-filaments—yet the dread felt *his*, marrow-deep and shameful."
    },
    {
      "line": 276,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s Applicator flared hot behind his temple."
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Diagnostics blazed crimson:"
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> VRILL RESONANCE INVERSION DETECTED"
    },
    {
      "line": 279,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> COGNITIVE CORRUPTION PROTOCOL ENGAGED"
    },
    {
      "line": 280,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> TRUTH FRAME SHIFT: SUGGESTION → MEMORY"
    },
    {
      "line": 281,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> MALLEATION EVENT IMMINENT"
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle exhaled decay-sweet breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 284,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s shoulders tensed beside him—not at Reptilian claws scraping stone, but at the whispers threading through dripping fronds."
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Private Ren’s blade trembled near a pulsing vine."
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re slowing down for *me*,\" the Legionnaire choked."
    },
    {
      "line": 287,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vine answered in Ren’s own voice, colder: \"Just like Mars.\" Ren’s knuckles whitened."
    },
    {
      "line": 288,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He knew the source—the grafted vrill was a parasite in the air—yet the shame felt bone-deep. *His* failing. *His* abandonment."
    },
    {
      "line": 290,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, Mika’s lance wavered."
    },
    {
      "line": 291,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shieldbearers formed overlapping barriers, but the corruption slithered beneath."
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An Igigi prisoner pressed against crystalline bars—his eyes vacant, lips moving: \"The chains fit better now...\" The vine above him crooned back: \"Quiet is safety.\" Geralt felt Luminara shudder."
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her golden light trembled against encroaching violet."
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This wasn’t attack."
    },
    {
      "line": 295,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was seduction."
    },
    {
      "line": 296,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Truth reborn as doubt."
    },
    {
      "line": 298,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion marched deeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 299,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Roots snaked across their path, throbbing like infected arteries."
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s salvaged armor sparked—emerald light flickering where it touched stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 301,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His fingers brushed a moss-slick obelisk."
    },
    {
      "line": 302,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instantly, Senareth’s voice echoed: *\"Endurance is surrender.\"* It wasn’t Senareth."
    },
    {
      "line": 303,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was Oreck’s deepest fear—wrapped in his mentor’s timbre."
    },
    {
      "line": 304,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He recoiled."
    },
    {
      "line": 305,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His bow clattered against rock."
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sound amplified tenfold, swallowed by jungle laughter."
    },
    {
      "line": 308,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 309,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His ax hovered mid-swing."
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the neural link, Geralt tasted copper and salt—the sergeant’s memory-flash: Mars, sand choking his brother’s lungs."
    },
    {
      "line": 311,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vines hissed: \"Too slow."
    },
    {
      "line": 312,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Always too slow.\" Halvar roared—not in battle-fury, but anguish."
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shadows deepened."
    },
    {
      "line": 314,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vril-light bent."
    },
    {
      "line": 315,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Garden remembered pain, and now it weaponized regret."
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Victory required more than blades."
    },
    {
      "line": 317,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It demanded belief in unraveling minds."
    },
    {
      "line": 319,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 320,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle’s whispers thickened as twilight bled into deep violet gloom."
    },
    {
      "line": 321,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s knuckles whitened around his axe handle; every rustling leaf echoed with his brother’s dying gasps from Mars."
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We stop *here*,\" Geralt commanded, slicing through the mental fog with Luminara’s flickering gold light."
    },
    {
      "line": 323,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The clearing was a trap—vines coiled like sleeping serpents, obelisks humming with inverted resonance—but exhaustion outweighed caution."
    },
    {
      "line": 324,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires collapsed against petrified logs, eyes darting at shifting shadows."
    },
    {
      "line": 325,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren’s hand trembled near his blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 326,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’ll slit our throats while we sleep,\" he muttered."
    },
    {
      "line": 327,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vine above him sighed back: \"*Sleep is surrender.*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 329,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck traced glyphs in the damp soil—ancient Martian warding sigils."
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His salvaged armor sputtered emerald light where it touched the symbols, pushing back the cognitive poison."
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The corruption targets doubt,\" he rasped, sweat stinging his eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 332,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Fix your thoughts."
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anchor them.\" Mika knelt beside him, her lance plunged into soft earth."
    },
    {
      "line": 334,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shield energy flared silver, carving a fragile dome of clarity."
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Within it, the air tasted cleaner—pine and ozone instead of decay."
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet outside, the jungle pulsed, alive with malice."
    },
    {
      "line": 337,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Distant Igigi whimpers twisted into accusations: \"*You abandoned us.*\""
    },
    {
      "line": 339,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar paced the perimeter, axe gleaming."
    },
    {
      "line": 340,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Focus on the weight,\" Geralt ordered, his Applicator scorching against his skull."
    },
    {
      "line": 341,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"*Feel* your boots crushing stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 342,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hear my voice.\" Ren flinched as vines whispered his darkest shame—the Martian outpost he’d fled."
    },
    {
      "line": 343,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Ignore echoes,\" Geralt growled."
    },
    {
      "line": 344,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re thorns, not truths.\" Luminara’s glow brightened, casting long, defiant shadows."
    },
    {
      "line": 345,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around them, the Legionnaires clutched weapons, lips moving in silent mantras: names of home, rhythms of drills, equations of vrill-flow."
    },
    {
      "line": 346,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Resistance was a raw, scraping thing—a refusal to let their minds be unmade."
    },
    {
      "line": 348,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Deep in the undergrowth, obsidian eyes watched."
    },
    {
      "line": 349,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three reptilian scouts, scales tuned to the corrupted harmonics, tasted the shield’s disruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 350,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their claws flexed, ready to rend flesh *or* sanity."
    },
    {
      "line": 351,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s gauntlet tightened on Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 352,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tonight, they’d hold this line."
    },
    {
      "line": 353,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tomorrow, they’d cut deeper toward the heart—and rip the poison from its roots."
    },
    {
      "line": 355,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 356,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle pressed closer, its whispers threading through the shield-dome like poisoned needles."
    },
    {
      "line": 357,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s axe trembled—not from fatigue, but from the vine-murmur replaying his brother’s last rattling breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 358,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He slammed the blade into the soil, anchoring himself in the vibration."
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Weight,\" Geralt commanded."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Focus on gravity.\" Legionnaires echoed the mantra, gripping weapons until knuckles bled white."
    },
    {
      "line": 361,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren’s eyelids fluttered as the corruption hissed: *Coward."
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weak.* He bit his tongue, tasting copper, and whispered his daughter’s name instead."
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A small defiance."
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, the canopy writhed."
    },
    {
      "line": 366,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet light pulsed through veins in the leaves—Anunnaki tech feeding on doubt."
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner flared crimson."
    },
    {
      "line": 368,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Cognitive resonance intensifying!"
    },
    {
      "line": 369,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shield integrity at 65%.\" Mika’s lance dug deeper into the earth, silver light fraying at the edges."
    },
    {
      "line": 370,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck pressed his palm against a glyph-carved obelisk."
    },
    {
      "line": 371,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald energy flared, pushing back the gloom."
    },
    {
      "line": 372,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re amplifying our fears,\" he rasped."
    },
    {
      "line": 373,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Twisting memory into traps.\" Senareth’s voice slithered from a nearby vine: *\"You failed me.\"* Oreck snarled, shattering the stone with a chroniton-charged arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The lie crumbled."
    },
    {
      "line": 376,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence followed—brief, electric."
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the jungle screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 379,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines lashed like whips, thorns gleaming with venom."
    },
    {
      "line": 380,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian shadows detached from the trees, claws scraping stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 381,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar roared, axe cleaving through scaled flesh."
    },
    {
      "line": 382,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s shield-wall flared, deflecting psychic shrieks that tasted of burnt ozone."
    },
    {
      "line": 383,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her golden light seared through the violet haze, revealing three scouts—obsidian-scaled, eyes vacant—advancing with mechanical precision."
    },
    {
      "line": 385,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Legionnaires met them blade-to-claw, screams swallowed by the storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 387,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One scout lunged at Ren."
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Time slowed."
    },
    {
      "line": 389,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legionnaire saw Martian sand, his own retreating footsteps."
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then Geralt’s voice cut through: \"Nowhere to run here.\" Ren’s blade found the creature’s throat."
    },
    {
      "line": 391,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Black blood sprayed."
    },
    {
      "line": 392,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle recoiled, hissing."
    },
    {
      "line": 394,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the lull, Oreck touched a dying scout’s armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 395,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Resonance flickered—a map of pain etched in vrill."
    },
    {
      "line": 396,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They’re conduits,\" he breathed."
    },
    {
      "line": 397,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The corruption flows *through* them.\" Geralt’s Applicator burned: *Parasitic symbiosis confirmed*."
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cut the scouts, and the roots would bleed."
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, thunder gathered."
    },
    {
      "line": 401,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not rain."
    },
    {
      "line": 402,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wings."
    },
    {
      "line": 403,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Darker."
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Closer."
    },
    {
      "line": 405,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shield-dome flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 406,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Victory was a shallow breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 407,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dawn felt lifetimes away."
    },
    {
      "line": 409,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck crouched beside the scout's corpse."
    },
    {
      "line": 410,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His fingers brushed cold scales, syncing his salvaged armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 411,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald light pulsed through the reptile's neural lattice—a fractal map of agony etched in vrill."
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Parasite lines fed into distant nodes."
    },
    {
      "line": 413,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They're not soldiers,\" he hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They're nerve endings."
    },
    {
      "line": 415,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pain amplifiers.\" Geralt's Applicator scalded his temple: VERIFIED."
    },
    {
      "line": 416,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "COGNITIVE CORRUPTION VECTORS: NEURAL-SYNTHETIC SYMBIOSIS."
    },
    {
      "line": 417,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "TERMINATE HOSTS TO SEVER FEEDBACK LOOPS."
    },
    {
      "line": 419,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar wiped black blood from his axe."
    },
    {
      "line": 420,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"So we kill the messengers?\" His voice was gravel scraped raw."
    },
    {
      "line": 422,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"Worse,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 424,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Private Ren stared at his bloodied blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 425,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then—we're helping them?\" The vine above him sighed: *Always helping.*"
    },
    {
      "line": 427,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika's shield flared silver as another psychic shriek hit—burnt ozone and despair."
    },
    {
      "line": 428,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"How do we fight a forest that eats doubt?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 430,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck's arrow hummed."
    },
    {
      "line": 431,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton-tipped."
    },
    {
      "line": 432,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We don't fight.\" He nocked it, aiming at the scout's twitching spine."
    },
    {
      "line": 433,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We cauterize.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 435,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shot was a whisper."
    },
    {
      "line": 436,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald light pierced scaled flesh."
    },
    {
      "line": 437,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instantly, the corpse *screamed*—not sound, but silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 438,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A vacuum that sucked the air from lungs."
    },
    {
      "line": 439,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines recoiled."
    },
    {
      "line": 440,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet pulses stuttered."
    },
    {
      "line": 442,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, the winged thunder faltered."
    },
    {
      "line": 444,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra's scanner chirruped."
    },
    {
      "line": 445,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Local corruption resonance... dropping?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 447,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt it—a tremor through Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 448,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Earth's sigh of relief."
    },
    {
      "line": 449,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But his Applicator blazed crimson: WARNING: NODE GAMMA REACTIVATING."
    },
    {
      "line": 450,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "PARASITE LOGIC ADAPTING."
    },
    {
      "line": 452,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck's armor flickered."
    },
    {
      "line": 453,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth's voice slithered from the ground: *You only delayed the harvest.*"
    },
    {
      "line": 455,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar growled."
    },
    {
      "line": 456,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They rebuilt faster.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 458,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"No.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 459,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stared at the scout's ashen scales. Black veins now glowed gold-*green*. The very hue of Oreck's arrow. \"They *learned*.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 461,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle held its breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 463,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the roots began to sing."
    },
    {
      "line": 465,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It started where Oreck’s chroniton arrow had struck—a low, dissonant hum vibrating through the scout’s corpse."
    },
    {
      "line": 466,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The gold-green veins pulsed like infected lightning, spreading through petrified wood and moss-slick stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 467,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where the Legion stood, the ground trembled—not in threat, but in terrible imitation."
    },
    {
      "line": 468,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines uncoiled, lifting toward the canopy as if conducting an unseen orchestra."
    },
    {
      "line": 469,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The notes tasted of copper and spoiled honey on Geralt’s tongue."
    },
    {
      "line": 471,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Private Ren clapped hands over his ears."
    },
    {
      "line": 472,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Make it stop—\" His plea fractured into the jungle’s stolen timbre."
    },
    {
      "line": 473,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"—stop pretending you can save us!\" The vines echoed, weaving his despair into harmony."
    },
    {
      "line": 474,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shieldbearers stumbled back as Mika’s lance dimmed; the silver dome flickered, its light thinning against the rising chorus."
    },
    {
      "line": 475,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar gripped his axe, knuckles pale."
    },
    {
      "line": 476,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It’s mirroring us,\" he growled."
    },
    {
      "line": 477,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Feeding on our silence.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 479,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra’s scanner shrieked."
    },
    {
      "line": 480,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Resonance replication detected!"
    },
    {
      "line": 481,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corruption adapting to chroniton frequency—\" Her voice broke as the jungle whispered her own diagnosis back: *Adaptation equals extinction.* Geralt slammed Luminara’s base into the soil."
    },
    {
      "line": 482,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Golden light flared, searing vines that crept too close."
    },
    {
      "line": 483,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator burned against his skull: PARASITE ISOLATING HOST NEURAL SIGNATURES."
    },
    {
      "line": 484,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ESTABLISHING RESONANT FEEDBACK LOOP."
    },
    {
      "line": 485,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But beneath the warning, a deeper truth shimmered: The green-gold veins weren’t just copying Oreck’s attack."
    },
    {
      "line": 486,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were *learning* it."
    },
    {
      "line": 487,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Perfecting it."
    },
    {
      "line": 489,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck crouched beside the scout, fingers pressed to corrupted scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 490,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His armor synced—emerald light writhing against gold-green intrusion."
    },
    {
      "line": 491,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the neural link, Geralt felt it: fractal patterns unfolding like poisoned flowers."
    },
    {
      "line": 492,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It’s not defense,\" Oreck breathed."
    },
    {
      "line": 493,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It’s rehearsal.\" Senareth’s voice coiled through the roots— *For the Garden’s requiem*."
    },
    {
      "line": 494,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above them, winged shadows banked lower, their flight paths syncing to the dissonant hymn."
    },
    {
      "line": 495,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air thickened with anticipation."
    },
    {
      "line": 497,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika raised her lance."
    },
    {
      "line": 498,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Do we retreat?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 499,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt watched a vine stroke Ren’s trembling shoulder."
    },
    {
      "line": 500,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Comfort now."
    },
    {
      "line": 501,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tender as a grave."
    },
    {
      "line": 502,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Stand fast,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 503,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "he ordered."
    },
    {
      "line": 504,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Let it listen closer.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 505,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara pulsed—not attack, but invitation."
    },
    {
      "line": 506,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her light carved a single, pure note into the cacophony."
    },
    {
      "line": 507,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A question only sorrow could answer."
    },
    {
      "line": 508,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle hesitated."
    },
    {
      "line": 509,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines froze mid-reach."
    },
    {
      "line": 510,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, the singing stuttered,"
    },
    {
      "line": 511,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "as if remembering it had no throat of its own."
    },
    {
      "line": 513,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the ground heaved."
    },
    {
      "line": 514,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stone split like rotten fruit."
    },
    {
      "line": 515,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From the fissure rose a serpentine root,"
    },
    {
      "line": 516,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "thicker than a warship’s hull,"
    },
    {
      "line": 517,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "studded with glittering Anunnaki emitters—"
    },
    {
      "line": 518,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "and humming with Ren’s stolen terror,"
    },
    {
      "line": 519,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s guilt,"
    },
    {
      "line": 520,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s faith."
    },
    {
      "line": 521,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma."
    },
    {
      "line": 522,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Awake."
    },
    {
      "line": 523,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alive."
    },
    {
      "line": 524,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hungry."
    },
    {
      "line": 526,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No one breathed."
    },
    {
      "line": 527,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion’s defiance echoed in the silence—"
    },
    {
      "line": 528,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "not as weapon,"
    },
    {
      "line": 529,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "but as bait."
    },
    {
      "line": 530,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vine-monster swayed,"
    },
    {
      "line": 531,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "drunk on their pain."
    },
    {
      "line": 532,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s fingers tightened on Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 533,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"Now.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 535,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 537,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The root-monster swayed—a grotesque parody of breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 538,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren’s terror thrummed through its bark-carved emitters; Halvar’s guilt pulsed in the veins of its thorns."
    },
    {
      "line": 539,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It didn’t attack."
    },
    {
      "line": 540,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It *listened*, drinking the Legion’s silence like poison wine."
    },
    {
      "line": 541,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s Applicator screamed:"
    },
    {
      "line": 542,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> RESONANCE FEEDBACK LOOP STABILIZED"
    },
    {
      "line": 543,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> NODE GAMMA ASSIMILATING HOST SIGNATURES"
    },
    {
      "line": 544,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> COUNTERMEASURES: NEGATIVE PROBABILITY"
    },
    {
      "line": 546,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s gold light sputtered as the root hummed louder—not a battle cry, but a twisted chorus of their own voices."
    },
    {
      "line": 547,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren whimpered as it sang *\"Coward\"* in his daughter’s stolen lilt."
    },
    {
      "line": 548,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s axe trembled; the vine mirrored his shaking grip."
    },
    {
      "line": 550,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck nocked another chroniton arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 551,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It’s reflecting us!\" His armor flared emerald, but Node Gamma instantly bled gold-green—copying the frequency."
    },
    {
      "line": 552,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dissonance scraped teeth."
    },
    {
      "line": 554,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Cease fire!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt barked. Every counterattack became data for the parasite. He forced stillness. Luminara dimmed to a dying ember."
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The jungle held its breath."
    },
    {
      "line": 559,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines coiled tighter."
    },
    {
      "line": 560,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dirt crumbled into the fissure as Node Gamma heaved upward, dripping acidic sap that hissed against Mika’s flickering shield."
    },
    {
      "line": 561,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air reeked of ozone and rotting orchids."
    },
    {
      "line": 563,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s knuckles cracked."
    },
    {
      "line": 564,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Do we die waiting?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 566,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"Wait longer,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 568,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A vine lashed toward Ren—slow, inquisitive."
    },
    {
      "line": 569,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It brushed his cheek, cold as reptilian scales."
    },
    {
      "line": 570,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He froze, tears carving paths through grime."
    },
    {
      "line": 571,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The root crooned: *\"Safe now.\"*"
    },
    {
      "line": 573,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s lance flared silver."
    },
    {
      "line": 574,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Now, commander—\""
    },
    {
      "line": 576,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Hold!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 577,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s voice cut steel."
    },
    {
      "line": 579,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vine tightened around Ren’s throat."
    },
    {
      "line": 580,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emerald veins pulsed."
    },
    {
      "line": 581,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma leaned in—a hunter savoring surrender."
    },
    {
      "line": 583,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s arrow trembled."
    },
    {
      "line": 584,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s breath roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 586,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the suffocating quiet, Geralt’s Applicator flickered once:"
    },
    {
      "line": 587,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> PARASITE ATTENTION THRESHOLD: 98%"
    },
    {
      "line": 588,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> READY—"
    },
    {
      "line": 590,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The root lunged."
    },
    {
      "line": 592,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren’s choked gasp echoed through the emitters—amplified into a shriek that shattered Mika’s shield-wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 593,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Acidic sap rained down as vines erupted from the fissure."
    },
    {
      "line": 594,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt drove Luminara into the soil."
    },
    {
      "line": 595,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her golden light flared—not against the root, but *through* it."
    },
    {
      "line": 596,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma’s core pulsed crimson where Ren’s stolen memories bled."
    },
    {
      "line": 597,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The parasite had consumed suffering."
    },
    {
      "line": 598,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now it choked on hope."
    },
    {
      "line": 600,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar moved first."
    },
    {
      "line": 601,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not toward the monster, but sideways—his axe carving sigils into stone Oreck had marked hours earlier."
    },
    {
      "line": 602,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Martian ward-runes flared emerald."
    },
    {
      "line": 603,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vines recoiled as ancestral geometry scorched their false flesh."
    },
    {
      "line": 604,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The distraction lasted seconds."
    },
    {
      "line": 605,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Long enough."
    },
    {
      "line": 607,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck loosed his arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 608,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not at the core, but into the soil where Node Gamma’s roots drank deep."
    },
    {
      "line": 609,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chroniton energy bloomed downward—a temporal anchor dragging the parasite toward its own creation moment."
    },
    {
      "line": 610,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The monster shuddered."
    },
    {
      "line": 611,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emitters spat static."
    },
    {
      "line": 612,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, Geralt saw it: the Anunnaki drill biting into virgin earth fifteen years past."
    },
    {
      "line": 613,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The root *remembered* being a weapon."
    },
    {
      "line": 615,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the memory curdled."
    },
    {
      "line": 616,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gold-green veins thickened, swallowing the chroniton pulse."
    },
    {
      "line": 617,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma learned—adapting its resonance to mimic Oreck’s armor frequency."
    },
    {
      "line": 618,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dissonance slammed Geralt to his knees."
    },
    {
      "line": 619,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara’s light fractured."
    },
    {
      "line": 620,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shadows deepened."
    },
    {
      "line": 622,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A vine wrapped Mika’s throat."
    },
    {
      "line": 623,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Another pinned Halvar’s axe-arm."
    },
    {
      "line": 624,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren sobbed as roots pried open his mind, mining fresh despair."
    },
    {
      "line": 626,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s Applicator burned:"
    },
    {
      "line": 627,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> PARASITE ADAPTATION RATE EXCEEDING TOLERANCES"
    },
    {
      "line": 628,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "> COUNTERMEASURE: RESONANT SACRIFICE?"
    },
    {
      "line": 629,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Y/"
    },
    {
      "line": 631,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn’t hesitate."
    },
    {
      "line": 633,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Standing, he ripped the Applicator from his temple."
    },
    {
      "line": 634,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blood streamed down his cheek as he pressed the scorching metal to Luminara’s haft."
    },
    {
      "line": 635,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Take it all,\" he whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 636,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not command."
    },
    {
      "line": 637,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Invitation."
    },
    {
      "line": 639,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The relic blazed—feeding on his pain, his doubt, the weight of every Legionnaire’s scream."
    },
    {
      "line": 640,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her light shifted from gold to blinding white."
    },
    {
      "line": 641,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma recoiled, emitters overloading as pure, unfiltered humanity flooded its circuits."
    },
    {
      "line": 643,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For the first time, the jungle screamed—not imitation, but agony."
    },
    {
      "line": 645,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika gasped free."
    },
    {
      "line": 646,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 648,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above them, wings dove through the canopy—too fast, too late."
    },
    {
      "line": 650,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck nocked his last arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 652,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The root twitched—not in retreat, but anticipation."
    },
    {
      "line": 653,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Learning again."
    },
    {
      "line": 654,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Always learning."
    },
    {
      "line": 656,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Here is the revised ending with the new twist about the Applicator — a rogue duplicate communicating with the hive, while the real one remains hidden and intact."
    },
    {
      "line": 658,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 660,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The blinding white light seared Geralt’s vision, throbbing against Node Gamma’s corrupted heart."
    },
    {
      "line": 661,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Acidic sap hissed where it struck vines, vaporizing into acrid clouds that stung the Legionnaires’ throats."
    },
    {
      "line": 662,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the glare, Geralt glimpsed the parasite’s core pulsing faster—not overwhelmed, but analyzing."
    },
    {
      "line": 663,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Absorbing."
    },
    {
      "line": 664,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its gold-green veins flared brighter, synchronizing with Luminara’s desperate resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 666,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren crumpled to his knees, clutching his temples."
    },
    {
      "line": 667,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It’s inside my skull,\" he choked."
    },
    {
      "line": 668,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Counting my breaths.\" The root echoed him perfectly: a thousand whispering vines replicating each ragged gasp."
    },
    {
      "line": 669,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s shield flickered back to life, silver light straining against the cognitive tide."
    },
    {
      "line": 670,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar swung his axe—not at the root, but at the rune-carved earth."
    },
    {
      "line": 671,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Martian glyphs flared emerald beneath its twisting tendrils."
    },
    {
      "line": 672,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stone groaned instead of screaming."
    },
    {
      "line": 673,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A distraction."
    },
    {
      "line": 675,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck didn’t flinch."
    },
    {
      "line": 676,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His arrow’s chroniton tip hummed with stolen time—the spark before impact."
    },
    {
      "line": 677,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He aimed low, beneath the root’s armored segments, toward threads binding it to the deeper network."
    },
    {
      "line": 678,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Feeding tube,\" he hissed."
    },
    {
      "line": 679,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt nodded, blood dripping from his temple onto Luminara’s haft."
    },
    {
      "line": 680,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The relic drank it greedily, light wavering between white and sickly gold-green imitation."
    },
    {
      "line": 681,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Parasite logic adapted."
    },
    {
      "line": 682,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Patience wore thin."
    },
    {
      "line": 684,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, wings shredded the canopy."
    },
    {
      "line": 685,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian scouts descended in silence, claws extended not for flesh, but for the fractured shield-dome."
    },
    {
      "line": 686,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their scales vibrated with the jungle’s stolen chorus—Halvar’s guilt, Ren’s terror, Oreck’s faith—amplified into weapons."
    },
    {
      "line": 687,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika met them with lance raised, her defiance a raw scream swallowed by dissonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 689,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth’s voice slithered through the roots once more: All gardens end."
    },
    {
      "line": 690,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt tightened his grip."
    },
    {
      "line": 691,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Not yet.\" Luminara pulsed—a final, searing note of pure defiance."
    },
    {
      "line": 692,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma shuddered, emitters flaring crimson."
    },
    {
      "line": 693,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a heartbeat, its song fractured into static."
    },
    {
      "line": 694,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 696,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the serpentine root lunged—not at Geralt, but at Oreck’s drawn bow."
    },
    {
      "line": 697,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Learning."
    },
    {
      "line": 698,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Always learning."
    },
    {
      "line": 700,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Geralt’s Applicator—the one fused to his temple—didn’t just analyze the attack."
    },
    {
      "line": 702,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It approved."
    },
    {
      "line": 704,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A faint, encrypted pulse bled from his skull into the root’s core."
    },
    {
      "line": 705,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 706,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A data packet."
    },
    {
      "line": 707,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma absorbed it instantly, its next movement preempting Oreck’s shot."
    },
    {
      "line": 708,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The arrow shattered mid-air."
    },
    {
      "line": 710,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 711,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not from pain."
    },
    {
      "line": 712,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From realization."
    },
    {
      "line": 714,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Emergency preservation tactics it began duplicity…"
    },
    {
      "line": 716,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Applicator had been compromised."
    },
    {
      "line": 717,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not corrupted—replaced."
    },
    {
      "line": 718,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A duplicate."
    },
    {
      "line": 719,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And it wasn’t just adapting to the hive."
    },
    {
      "line": 721,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was communicating with it."
    },
    {
      "line": 723,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every tactical readout, every resonance scan, every flicker of Legionnaire fear—it had been streaming to Node Gamma."
    },
    {
      "line": 724,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The parasite wasn’t learning on its own."
    },
    {
      "line": 725,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was being taught."
    },
    {
      "line": 727,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar roared, axe biting deep into a vine—but the vine had already hardened at the point of impact."
    },
    {
      "line": 728,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pre-adapted."
    },
    {
      "line": 729,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Betrayed."
    },
    {
      "line": 731,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s hand shot to his temple."
    },
    {
      "line": 732,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not to deactivate it."
    },
    {
      "line": 734,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To rip it out."
    },
    {
      "line": 736,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The duplicate Applicator resisted, bio-filaments tearing from his neural ports."
    },
    {
      "line": 737,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It shrieked in his mind—not a machine error, but a hive-alert."
    },
    {
      "line": 738,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gold-green light bled from its casing as it came free, writhing in his grip like a caught insect."
    },
    {
      "line": 739,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For a second, he saw it clearly: a perfect replica, down to the wear on its edges."
    },
    {
      "line": 740,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But inside, its core glowed with the same venomous violet as the jungle’s emitters."
    },
    {
      "line": 742,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He crushed it against Luminara’s haft."
    },
    {
      "line": 743,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The duplicate sparked, died, and went dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 745,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 747,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma hesitated."
    },
    {
      "line": 748,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its song stuttered, emitters cycling through frequencies—searching for the feed that had just gone dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 749,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was blind."
    },
    {
      "line": 750,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For the first time, it was truly alone."
    },
    {
      "line": 752,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And in that silence, Geralt’s real Applicator—the one buried in his occipital nerve cluster, dormant since Mars—booted up."
    },
    {
      "line": 754,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No fanfare."
    },
    {
      "line": 755,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No diagnostic chime."
    },
    {
      "line": 756,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just a clean, cold stream of data across his vision:"
    },
    {
      "line": 758,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "PRIMARY APPLICATOR ONLINE."
    },
    {
      "line": 759,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "DUPLICATE LOG TERMINATED."
    },
    {
      "line": 760,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "HIVE FEEDBACK LOOP SEVERED."
    },
    {
      "line": 761,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ANALYSIS: NODE GAMMA RESONANCE PATTERN LOCKED TO DUPLICATE PROTOCOLS."
    },
    {
      "line": 762,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "PROTOCOL DELTA ENGAGED: COUNTER-RESONANCE MIRRORING READY."
    },
    {
      "line": 764,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s lips curled."
    },
    {
      "line": 765,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a smile."
    },
    {
      "line": 766,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A baring of teeth."
    },
    {
      "line": 768,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The duplicate had been feeding the hive their strategies."
    },
    {
      "line": 769,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now, the real Applicator would feed the hive its own."
    },
    {
      "line": 771,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He raised Luminara."
    },
    {
      "line": 772,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not in defiance."
    },
    {
      "line": 773,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In invitation."
    },
    {
      "line": 775,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "“You wanted our resonance?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 776,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s voice cut through the stillness. “Here it is. Filtered. Weaponized.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 778,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He let the real Applicator flood Node Gamma with a perfected, mirrored echo of everything the duplicate had sent—but inverted."
    },
    {
      "line": 779,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s guilt became resolve."
    },
    {
      "line": 780,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ren’s terror became clarity."
    },
    {
      "line": 781,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s faith became certainty."
    },
    {
      "line": 782,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The parasite, trained on the duplicate’s data, couldn’t adapt."
    },
    {
      "line": 783,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It choked on the contradiction."
    },
    {
      "line": 785,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma screamed—a raw, mechanical shriek untouched by stolen souls."
    },
    {
      "line": 786,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its gold-green veins blackened, seared by the truth of its own stolen logic."
    },
    {
      "line": 788,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Above, wings faltered, scouts tumbling from the sky as their harmonic link shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 789,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shield-dome flared pure silver, Mika’s lance blazing with renewed light."
    },
    {
      "line": 791,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar didn’t need an order."
    },
    {
      "line": 792,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His axe found the root’s core."
    },
    {
      "line": 793,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This time, it bit deep."
    },
    {
      "line": 794,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This time, it bled black."
    },
    {
      "line": 796,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dawn’s first light pierced the canopy."
    },
    {
      "line": 798,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It found them broken."
    },
    {
      "line": 799,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bleeding."
    },
    {
      "line": 801,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But united."
    },
    {
      "line": 802,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And aware."
    },
    {
      "line": 804,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The real war wasn’t just against the jungle."
    },
    {
      "line": 806,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was against the lies they carried with them."
    },
    {
      "line": 808,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And Geralt’s real Applicator was now wide awake, listening not to the hive—"
    },
    {
      "line": 810,
      "type": "narration",
